<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     FILE: Themes/Styles/AboutSurface.xaml
     PROJECT: ProGlassAutomation
     MODULE: About — card / tile / chip corner radii (the live scale)

     2026-09-16 — owner report: "why about page cards still not accepting
     dynamic card corner border color from monet engine etc."

     WHY THESE ARE HERE AND NOT IN Views/About
     ────────────────────────────────────────
     They used to be local constants in Views/About/AboutIos26Theme.xaml.
     A key declared in a dictionary merged LOCALLY by a view SHADOWS
     Application.Resources, so:

       • the card-corner slider in Settings → Appearance could never reach
         the About cards (they stayed at the mockup's 26 px);
       • nor could a visual family (Monet / iOS 26 / Crystal Fluid /
         Normal industrial), which writes CardCornerRadius and the
         Radius.* primitives of its own;
       • and republishing the key at application scope did NOTHING,
         because the local declaration still won the lookup.

     Values: the approved mockup, verbatim — 26 px cards, 12 px inner
     tiles, 10 px icon tiles, 12 px chips, 6 px small. They are the
     FALLBACK the first frame paints with. From the first theme apply
     onward, Services/Theme/AboutSurfaceTokens.cs republishes this scale
     from the ONE radius authority in the app (ThemeManager
     .ApplyCardCornerRadius → CardCornerRadius, default 12), using the
     mockup's own ratios:

       26/12 · 12/12 · 10/12 · 12/12 · 6/12  →  at 12 px: 26, 12, 10, 12, 6

     so the default configuration renders the approved design exactly and
     anything else scales from it. Radius.Bar (999, bar-only full round)
     and the card shadow stay in the module dictionary — they are design
     geometry that must not move.

     Do NOT re-declare these inside Views/About: AboutModuleAuditTests
     fails the build if the module freezes its own surface tokens again.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<ResourceDictionary
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <CornerRadius x:Key="Ios26RadiusCard">26</CornerRadius>
    <CornerRadius x:Key="Ios26RadiusInner">12</CornerRadius>
    <CornerRadius x:Key="Ios26RadiusTile">10</CornerRadius>
    <CornerRadius x:Key="Ios26RadiusChip">12</CornerRadius>
    <CornerRadius x:Key="Ios26RadiusSmall">6</CornerRadius>
</ResourceDictionary>
